   110	
   111	[Next ZKIR and recursion requirements](MORIARTY-BACKEND-REQUIREMENTS.md) separate mandatory correctness contracts, required capabilities and measured usability targets. They assign obligations to ZKIR, compiler, proof runtime, ledger and Moriarty rather than assuming new instructions alone solve authorization, privacy or settlement. The initial execution target remains ZKIRv3; requests for the next version do not claim a ZKIRv4 release or prescribe its numbering.
